  "solution": "**BODMAS Table:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\n**Decoding the given information:**\n\n \n \n\n **Symbols**\n **A**\n **B**\n **C**\n **D**\n **E**\n \n \n\n **meaning**\n **+**\n **-**\n **×**\n **÷**\n **=**\n \n \n\nLet's check each option One by One:\n\nOption 1) 4 + 9 × __**6 **____**÷**____** 2 **__= 40 + 9\n\n4 + __**9 × 3**__ = 40 + 9\n\n__**4 + 27**__ = __**40 + 9**__\n\n31 ≠ 49.\n\nOption 2) 4 + 9 × __**6 ÷ 2**__ - 40 = 9\n\n4 + __**9 × 3**__ - 40 = 9\n\n__**4 + 27**__ - 40 = 9\n\n__**31 - 40**__ = 9\n\n-9 ≠ 9.\n\n \n\n**Option 3)** 4 + 9 × __**6 ÷ 2 **__= 40 - 9\n\n4 + __**9 × 3**__ = 40 - 9\n\n__**4 + 27**__ = 40 - 9\n\n31 = __**40 - 9**__\n\n**31 = 31.** \n\nOption 4) 4 + 9 = __**6 ÷ 2**__ × 40 - 9\n\n4 + 9 = __**3 × 40**__ - 9\n\n__**4 + 9**__ = 120 - 9\n\n13 = __**120 - 9**__\n\n13 ≠ 111.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 3'.***",
